---
// Discord's @everyone hot partition: before (every read hits the partition) and
// after (a Rust data service coalesces identical reads into one query).
function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const len = 8;
  const p1 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${(x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)).toFixed(1)} ${(y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)).toFixed(1)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}
const W = 900;
const H = 400;
const before = [
  arrow(190, 100, 330, 85),
  arrow(190, 110, 330, 110),
  arrow(190, 120, 330, 135),
  arrow(560, 110, 680, 110),
];
const after = [
  arrow(190, 300, 300, 285),
  arrow(190, 310, 300, 310),
  arrow(190, 320, 300, 335),
  arrow(550, 310, 680, 310),
];
---
<figure class="shdc">
  <div class="shdc-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="How Discord handled an @everyone ping. Before: many readers query one Cassandra partition for the channel directly, the partition turns hot and quorum latency rises across the replicas. After: the same reads go to a Rust data service that routes each channel to one worker, which sends a single query to ScyllaDB and shares the answer.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Before: every reader hits the partition</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trước: mọi người đọc đều đánh vào partition</tspan></text>

      <rect x="20" y="70" width="170" height="80" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="105" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Many readers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Rất nhiều người đọc</tspan></text>
      <text x="105" y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>after an @everyone ping</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sau một ping @everyone</tspan></text>
      {before.slice(0, 3).map((a) => (<g><path d={a.line} class="arrow is-hot" /><polygon points={a.head} class="head is-hot" /></g>))}

      <rect x="330" y="60" width="230" height="100" rx="6" class="box is-hot" />
      <text x="445" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="b is-hot"><tspan data-lang-en>One Cassandra partition</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một partition Cassandra</tspan></text>
      <text x="445" y="121" text-anchor="middle" class="s">(channel_id, bucket)</text>
      <text x="445" y="141" text-anchor="middle" class="s is-hot"><tspan data-lang-en>the same rows read over and over</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cùng các dòng bị đọc lặp đi lặp lại</tspan></text>
      <path d={before[3].line} class="arrow is-hot" /><polygon points={before[3].head} class="head is-hot" />

      <rect x="680" y="70" width="200" height="80" rx="6" class="box is-hot" />
      <text x="780" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="b is-hot"><tspan data-lang-en>Replica nodes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Các node replica</tspan></text>
      <text x="780" y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="s is-hot"><tspan data-lang-en>quorum latency climbs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>độ trễ quorum tăng vọt</tspan></text>

      <line x1="20" x2="880" y1="200" y2="200" class="rule" />
      <text x="20" y="232" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>After: one worker per channel asks once</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sau: mỗi kênh một worker, chỉ hỏi một lần</tspan></text>

      <rect x="20" y="270" width="170" height="80" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="105" y="304" text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Many readers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Rất nhiều người đọc</tspan></text>
      <text x="105" y="324" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>same ping, same channel</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cùng ping, cùng kênh</tspan></text>
      {after.slice(0, 3).map((a) => (<g><path d={a.line} class="arrow is-strong" /><polygon points={a.head} class="head is-strong" /></g>))}

      <rect x="300" y="260" width="250" height="100" rx="6" class="box is-active" />
      <text x="425" y="298" text-anchor="middle" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Rust data service</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Data service bằng Rust</tspan></text>
      <text x="425" y="319" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>same channel goes to the same worker</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cùng một kênh vào cùng một worker</tspan></text>
      <text x="425" y="339" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>waiting reads share one answer</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>các lệnh đọc chờ dùng chung một kết quả</tspan></text>
      <path d={after[3].line} class="arrow is-strong" /><polygon points={after[3].head} class="head is-strong" />
      <text x="615" y="300" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>1 query</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 truy vấn</tspan></text>

      <rect x="680" y="270" width="200" height="80" rx="6" class="box" />
      <text x="780" y="304" text-anchor="middle" class="b">ScyllaDB</text>
      <text x="780" y="324" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>partition stays calm</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>partition vẫn êm</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Discord's fix for the hot channel: route all reads for one channel to one worker and let it send a single query. Discord reports this, together with the move to ScyllaDB, cut historical-read p99 from 40 to 125 ms to about 15 ms.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cách Discord xử lý kênh quá nóng: dồn mọi lệnh đọc của một kênh về một worker, worker đó chỉ gửi một truy vấn. Discord cho biết cách này cùng việc chuyển sang ScyllaDB đã kéo p99 đọc tin cũ từ 40 đến 125 ms xuống còn khoảng 15 ms.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .shdc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .shdc-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .shdc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .shdc text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .shdc .h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .shdc .sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .shdc .b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .shdc .b.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .shdc .s { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .shdc .s.is-hot { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .shdc .note { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .shdc .note.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .shdc .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .shdc .box.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .shdc .box.is-active { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.7; }
  .shdc .box.is-dim { opacity: 0.5; }
  .shdc .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 5 5; fill: none; }
  .shdc .arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .shdc .arrow.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); }
  .shdc .arrow.is-strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.7; }
  .shdc .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .shdc .head.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .shdc .head.is-strong { fill: var(--text); }
  .shdc figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
